## . [yarn-workspace] JavaScript tools=yarn
build                    Build          declared exact  safe        .          yarn build :: Run build in all workspace packages
test                     Testing        declared exact  safe        .          yarn test :: Run test in all workspace packages
publish:all              Release        declared exact  external    .          yarn publish:all :: Publish the package to npm
## packages/core [@yarn/core] JavaScript tools=yarn
core:build               Build          declared exact  safe        .          yarn workspace @yarn/core build :: Build TypeScript project references
core:test                Testing        declared exact  safe        .          yarn workspace @yarn/core test :: Run Node.js tests
core:docs                Build          declared exact  safe        .          yarn workspace @yarn/core docs :: Generate API docs with TypeDoc
